1. She has a grandmother figure named Nana Ellie who disapproves of certain mild swears like "crap," "what the hell," "oh my god," preferring "what the heck" or "oh my gosh." (Verbatim: "nana elia would also get mad if i say like um what the hell because it's supposed to be what the heck")

