4. She does not know how to drive and has expressed interest in learning. (Verbatim: "I don't drive i was thinking i should probably learn to drive um it would be good if i figured that out.")

5. She is too afraid to cycle on roads due to fear of being run over and holding up traffic. (Verbatim: "I could not it's too scary to cycle on the road i don't know how they do it i feel like i'd be too much of um i'd be too in the way and too scared of being run over.")

6. She avoids swearing both on and off stream, believing it gives more impact when someone who never swears finally does. (Verbatim: "I don't swear on stream i don't swear off stream... one it provides power to when you do swear because then people are like oh she never swears she must be really mad.")

